  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a mythical realm with the custom Dragon Quilt Set by Jeminise. Perfect for fantasy enthusiasts and animal lovers of all ages, this cozy bedding set adds a touch of magic to kids, boys, girls, and teens' rooms alike. Featuring a captivating green dragon fantasy design, it provides both comfort and a unique, personal touch to your sleeping space.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable text input field allowing you to add a custom name or request to make this bedding truly yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Crafted from a high-quality microfiber and cotton-polyester blend for a soft, breathable, and comfortable night's sleep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Fantasy Motif:</strong> Showcases a stunning green dragon illustration set against a galaxy pattern, perfect for room decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin and Queen sizes to fit your specific bedroom setup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flexible Set Options:</strong> Optional matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) can be selected to complete your personalized bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric ensures simple maintenance and long-lasting freshness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragon Quilt D1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy, Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon, Fantasy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses</th>\n<td>Napping, Bedding</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
